[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STD008
TITLE: Landing, go-around, and sequence cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft test shall read back a sequence and a runway assignment without moving, shall say Going around for a pilot go-around and for a controller Go around, and shall climb. The mission test shall include the landing request and the landing readback. Acceptance is the sequence phrase, both go-around phrases, a go-around phase, and a mission phrase log that contains the landing clearance. The test files are apps/aircraft/tests/test_aircraft.py and apps/aircraft/tests/test_mission.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
These cases share the airborne and sequence checks.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
